{"embedding_dim": 768, "data": [{"__id__": "ent-8914fa4926641df00f1b2a4fda3f0782", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Attic", "content": "Attic\nThe Attic is a location where Marisol finds the old mirror.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-118e02a11eb3d4adf66f1387bd7d9af7", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Silver Blossoms ", "content": "Silver Blossoms \nThe Silver Blossoms are a decorative element on the old mirror.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-0e05937bddc6620a746f3116dee0b46c", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Marisol", "content": "Marisol\nMarisol is a character who discovers an old mirror in the attic.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-8926937bb54e3b3f8064fce00b851b8a", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Attic World ", "content": "Attic World \nMarisol enters the Attic World through the old mirror, finding herself under a canopy of rainbow petals.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-08004cfe5b6cb1b4107e313074d3ff96", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Old Mirror ", "content": "Old Mirror \nThe Old Mirror is described as heavy, framed in tarnished silver blossoms, and deeper than it should have been.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-efef7b9e296561b0ceaee651b05da03a", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Woman with Smoke Hair ", "content": "Woman with Smoke Hair \nThe Woman with Smoke Hair is a character who appears to Marisol in the mirror.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-9ff8fef0de9175d4bd6e3ebabdf0f22d", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Lanterns ", "content": "Lanterns \nThe Lanterns are described as hanging overhead in the garden within the Attic World.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-23aa44ff1edb6638837bfa8be16560e7", "__created_at__": 1754669469, "entity_name": "Rainbow Petals ", "content": "Rainbow Petals \nThe Rainbow Petals are a feature of the Attic World that Marisol enters through the old mirror.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-5238c87a4be4a6a2ea345d74aed1f035", "__created_at__": 1754669471, "entity_name": "Crow ", "content": "Crow \nThe Crow is a character that speaks in riddles and guides Marisol in the Attic World.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}, {"__id__": "ent-f6835396f701c6576533245144dc842c", "__created_at__": 1754669471, "entity_name": "Moonlight Paths ", "content": "Moonlight Paths \nThe Moonlight Paths are a feature of the Attic World that Marisol experiences.", "source_id": "chunk-7dbbd3e72d696acd9b85621cdff97d7f", "file_path": "unknown_source"}], "matrix": ""}